<title>USA: Stone Street Bancorp Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Stone Street Bancorp Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOCKSVILLE, N.C. 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		     N.A.</p>
<p> Net			    269			253</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,825		     N.A.</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The bank converted to a stock chartered savings bank from a mutual chartered bank earlier this year.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 includes a special FDIC assessment of $456,000. Without the assessment, 1996 Q3 net income would have been about $515,000.</p>
<p>Total assets at Sept. 30, 1996: $107.9 million.</p>
<p>Deposits at Sept. 30, 1996: $68.4 million.</p>
